 O3:['Ritual performance alone does not supply the defining Creator-belief.','Membership in a particular revealed religion is narrower than the category being defined.','A fully elaborated worldview and ideology is more than the minimum classification criterion asked for.'],
 O4:['The first clause wrongly separates the concepts completely, and specific laws are narrower than general practical ideology.','Ideology does not replace the worldview that grounds it.','This reverses the descriptive beliefs and practical prescriptions.'],
 O5:['Tawhid is one of the shared three.','Maad or the Hereafter is one of the shared three.','Nubuwwah or prophethood is one of the shared three.'],
